# Terraform working directories and state files
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform*
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate*
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info


# Local variable values and sensitive credentials
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
**/*.tfvars.json
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json

# Explicit path targeting the infrastructure tfvars
infrastructure/terraform.tfvars

# SSH keys and local secrets
*.pem
*.id_rsa
*.pub

# OS and IDE specific files
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/